le="margin-bottom:12px"><div style="border-bottom:2px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;padding-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase">Core Competencies</div></div><div style="display:grid;gap:5px 16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr)"><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Strategic Planning</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Financial Modeling</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Data Analysis</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>SQL</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Operating Model Design</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Stakeholder Management</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Change Management</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Private Equity Due Diligence</div><div style="align-items:center;color:#1e293b;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px"><span style="background:#4f46e5;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:5px"></span>Process Optimization</div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><div style="border-bottom:2px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;padding-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase">Professional Experience</div></div><div style="margin-bottom:18px"><div style="align-items:baseline;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:1px"><span style="color:#0f172a;font-family:&#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">Senior Associate</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;margin-left:10px;white-space:nowrap">Sep 2019 – Present</span></div><div style="color:#4f46e5;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">McKinsey &amp; Company | Boston, MA</div><p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:11px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 5px">Lead consulting engagements for financial services and healthcare clients, delivering $80M+ in measurable client value through digital transformation and operating model design.</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Designed and implemented a target operating model for a regional bank&#x27;s digital lending division, reducing loan origination cycle time by 52% and generating $12M in annual cost savings</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Built integrated data analytics platform for a top-5 health insurer, enabling real-time claims adjudication and reducing fraud losses by $8M annually</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Structured and scaled operating model frameworks for three growth-stage companies expanding from 200 to 1,000+ employees across North America and Europe</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Delivered executive strategy presentations to C-suite and board audiences with 100% client satisfaction ratings across 11 engagements</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Managed cross-functional team of 6 consultants and 4 client co-leads on a 9-month enterprise-wide ERP transformation program</span></li></ul></div><div style="margin-bottom:0"><div style="align-items:baseline;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:1px"><span style="color:#0f172a;font-family:&#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">Associate Consultant</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;margin-left:10px;white-space:nowrap">Jul 2017 – Aug 2019</span></div><div style="color:#4f46e5;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">Bain &amp; Company | Boston, MA</div><p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:11px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 5px">Executed commercial due diligence, market entry strategy, and operational improvement engagements for private equity and retail clients.</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Developed detailed financial models and market sizing analyses for $2B+ private equity investment targets across logistics and healthcare services sectors</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Led cross-functional workshops aligning executive leadership teams on post-merger integration priorities, accelerating Day 1 readiness by 3 weeks</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Identified $22M in overhead reduction opportunities for a specialty retailer through zero-based budgeting and procurement benchmarking</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:8px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#4f46e5;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">◆</span><span>Produced competitive landscape and customer segmentation analysis that shaped a $180M product portfolio reallocation for a consumer goods client</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><div style="border-bottom:2px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;padding-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase">Education</div></div><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><div style="align-items:baseline;display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span style="color:#0f172a;font-family:&#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">MBA, Strategy &amp; General Management</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;margin-left:10px;white-space:nowrap">2015 – 2017</span></div><div style="color:#4f46e5;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">Harvard Business School | Boston, MA</div></div><div style="margin-bottom:0"><div style="align-items:baseline;display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span style="color:#0f172a;font-family:&#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">Bachelor of Science, Economics</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;margin-left:10px;white-space:nowrap">2011 – 2015</span></div><div style="color:#4f46e5;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">University of Pennsylvania | Philadelphia, PA</div><div style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px">GPA: 3.9/4.0</div></div></div><div><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><div style="border-bottom:2px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;padding-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase">Certifications &amp; Professional Development</div></div><div style="display:grid;gap:6px 24px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><div><span style="color:#0f172a;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">Project Management Professional (PMP)</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px"> | PMI (2020)</span></div><div><span style="color:#0f172a;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700">Six Sigma Green Belt</span><span style="color:#64748b;font-size:10.5px"> | ASQ (2019)</span></div></div></div></div>"`;

