exports[`resume templates creative renders its sample résumé 1`] = `"<div style="background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:&#x27;Inter&#x27;, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;min-height:1123px;width:794px"><div style="align-items:center;background:#fff;border-bottom:2px solid #fce7f3;display:flex;gap:20px;padding:32px 40px 28px"><div style="align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ec4899,#9333ea);border-radius:50%;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-shrink:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;height:64px;justify-content:center;width:64px">DK</div><div style="flex:1"><h1 style="color:#0f172a;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 3px">David Kim</h1><div style="color:#ec4899;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Senior Product Designer</div><div style="color:#6b7280;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px;gap:0 16px"><span><span style="color:#ec4899;margin-right:3px">✉</span>david.kim@email.com</span><span><span style="color:#ec4899;margin-right:3px">✆</span>+1 (650) 555-0123</span><span><span style="color:#ec4899;margin-right:3px">⌖</span>San Francisco, CA</span></div></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex:1"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;padding:32px 36px 32px 40px"><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#ec4899;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase">Profile</span><div style="background:#ec4899;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.5"></div></div><p style="color:#374151;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:0">Product designer with 7+ years crafting human-centered experiences for consumer and enterprise products. Passionate about systems thinking, accessibility, and bridging the gap between research insights and pixel-perfect execution.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#ec4899;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase">Employment History</span><div style="background:#ec4899;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.5"></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px"><div style="color:#9ca3af;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.45;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:70px">Apr 2021–<br/>Present</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1px">Senior Product Designer</div><div style="color:#ec4899;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Airbnb</div><div style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:5px">San Francisco, CA</div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Redesigned the host onboarding flow using continuous discovery and A/B testing, increasing listing completion rate by 35% and reducing average time-to-live from 9 days to 4 days</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Established a shared design system with 120+ production-ready components adopted by 15 product teams, reducing design-to-dev handoff time by 40%</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Led a 6-month accessibility audit and remediation effort, bringing core host surfaces to WCAG 2.1 AA compliance and improving ratings among users with disabilities by 28%</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Mentored 3 mid-level designers through weekly critiques, design sprints, and structured growth plans; two received promotions within 12 months</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Partnered with Data Science to build a qualitative-quantitative research repository, reducing time to insight for new feature explorations by 50%</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:0"><div style="color:#9ca3af;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.45;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:70px">Jun 2018–<br/>Mar 2021</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1px">Product Designer</div><div style="color:#ec4899;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Dropbox</div><div style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:10px;margin-bottom:5px">San Francisco, CA</div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Shipped the Spaces product from 0-to-1, running 14 rounds of usability testing and iterating from concept to GA in 11 months; feature drove 22% increase in team retention</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Created interactive prototypes in Figma and ProtoPie that enabled C-level product reviews and accelerated stakeholder sign-off by an average of 3 weeks</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Contributed 40+ reusable components to the Dropbox Design System, reducing inconsistency bugs reported by engineering by 65%</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11px;gap:6px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#ec4899;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700">→</span><span>Partnered with User Research on 8 longitudinal diary studies, surfacing collaboration pain points that directly informed 3 roadmap priorities</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#ec4899;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase">Education</span><div style="background:#ec4899;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.5"></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:0"><div style="color:#9ca3af;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.45;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:70px">2014–2018</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700">BFA in Graphic Design</div><div style="color:#ec4899;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">Rhode Island School of Design, Providence, RI</div></div></div></div></div><div style="background:#fdf2f8;box-sizing:border-box;flex-shrink:0;padding:32px 24px;width:220px"><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><div style="margin-bottom:10px"><span style="color:#ec4899;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase">Skills</span><div style="background:#ec4899;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.5"></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Product Design</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">User Research</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Interaction Design</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">☆</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Figma</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Sketch</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">☆</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Adobe Creative Suite</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">☆</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">☆</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Prototyping</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span><span style="color:#ec4899">★</span></span></div><div><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Design Systems</div><span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px"><span sty