tyle="margin-bottom:8px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase">Skills</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.4"></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Machine Learning</div><span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px"><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Genomics</div><span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px"><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">○</span></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">Python</div><span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px"><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">R</div><span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px"><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">○</span><span style="color:#d1d5db">○</span></span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#374151;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">TensorFlow</div><span style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px"><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span><span style="color:#0d9488">●</span></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:20px"><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase">Technical</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px;opacity:0.4"></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px"><span style="background:#f0fdfa;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #99f6e4;color:#0d9488;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 7px">High-Performance Computing</span><span style="background:#f0fdfa;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #99f6e4;color:#0d9488;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 7px">Single-Cell Analysis</span><span style="background:#f0fdfa;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #99f6e4;color:#0d9488;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 7px">Bioinformatics</span></div></div></div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;flex:1;padding:40px 36px"><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><h1 style="color:#0f172a;font-family:&#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 4px">Dr. Vikram Nair</h1><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px">Assistant Professor · Computational Biology</div><div style="align-items:center;display:flex;gap:8px"><div style="background:#0d9488;flex:1;height:1.5px"></div><div style="background:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;height:7px;transform:rotate(45deg);width:7px"></div><div style="background:#0d9488;flex:1;height:1.5px"></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Research Interests</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><p style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.75;margin:0">Computational biologist and assistant professor specializing in machine learning applications for cancer genomics and single-cell transcriptomics. Committed to open-science principles, interdisciplinary collaboration, and training the next generation of computational researchers.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Employment History</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.4;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:90px">Jul 2020–<br/>Present</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1px">Assistant Professor</div><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px">Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA</div><p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:11.5px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 5px">Leads the Nair Computational Genomics Lab (8 researchers: 3 PhD students, 2 postdocs, 2 research scientists, 1 lab manager), focusing on cancer genomics and drug response prediction.</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Secured $2.5M in extramural funding from NIH R01, NSF CAREER, and Chan Zuckerberg Initiative over 3 grant cycles</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Published 12 peer-reviewed articles in Nature Methods, Cell Systems, and Genome Research; h-index increased from 9 to 18 since joining faculty</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Developed and teach two graduate courses (BMI 210: Computational Genomics; BMI 315: Applied ML in Medicine) with average teaching evaluations of 4.8/5.0</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Co-founded the Harvard Computational Biology Seminar Series, coordinating 24 invited speakers per academic year across 6 departments</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Mentored 5 undergraduate researchers; 4 co-authored publications and 3 went on to top-10 PhD programs</span></li></ul></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:0"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.4;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:90px">Sep 2017–<br/>Jun 2020</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1px">Postdoctoral Fellow</div><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px">Broad Institute, Cambridge, MA</div><p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:11.5px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 5px">Developed deep learning models for predicting cancer drug response from multi-omic patient data, advised by Dr. Levi Garraway.</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Built transformer-based model predicting drug sensitivity across 50 compounds with AUC 0.91, outperforming prior state-of-the-art by 12 percentage points</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Analyzed CRISPR knockout screens from 1,000+ cell lines to identify synthetic lethal gene pairs relevant to BRCA1/2-mutant cancers</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Published 8 peer-reviewed papers including first-author articles in Nature Genetics and Bioinformatics</span></li><li style="color:#374151;display:flex;font-size:11.5px;gap:7px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:#0d9488;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:900">›</span><span>Presented research at ASHG, RECOMB, and ISMB; received Best Poster Award at RECOMB 2019</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Education</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:90px">2012–2017</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">PhD in Biomedical Informatics</div><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">Stanford University, Stanford, CA</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:0"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px;font-style:italic;padding-top:2px;text-align:right;width:90px">2008–2012</div><div style="flex:1"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:13px;font-weight:800">Bachelor of Science in Computer Science &amp; Biology</div><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">MIT, Cambridge, MA</div><div style="color:#64748b;font-size:11px">GPA: 4.0/4.0</div></div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Research Projects</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><div style="border-left:3px solid #0d9488;margin-bottom:14px;padding-left:14px"><div style="color:#0f172a;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:3px">OpenGRAVITY Cancer Atlas</div><p style="color:#4b5563;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 4px">Federated learning atlas accelerating pan-cancer biomarker discovery across 14 institutions without raw data sharing.</p><div style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic">Methods: Python, Snakemake, Docker</div></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Technical Skills</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 0"><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">Machine Learning<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">Genomics<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">Python<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">R<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">TensorFlow<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">High-Performance Computing<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">Single-Cell Analysis<span style="color:#0d9488;margin:0 7px">·</span></span><span style="color:#374151;font-size:11.5px">Bioinformatics</span></div></div><div><div style="margin-bottom:12px"><span style="color:#0d9488;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Certifications &amp; Awards</span><div style="background:#0d9488;height:1.5px;margin-top:4px"></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;text-align:right;width:90px">2021</div><div style="color:#0f172a;flex:1;font-size:11.5px"><span style="font-weight:700">NIH IRACU Bioinformatics Workshop</span><span style="color:#64748b"> — NIH</span></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-bottom:8px"><div style="color:#64748b;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10.5px;font-style:italic;text-align:right;width:90px">2019</div><div style="color:#0f172a;flex:1;font-size:11.5px"><span style="font-weight:700">Data Carpentry: Genomics</span><span style="color:#64748b"> — Data Carpentry</span></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

